Package: EnvChemAnalysis
Type: Package
Title: Environmental Chemical Database Summary and Half-Life Assessment
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 23-November-2026
Author: Jack Giordano
Maintainer: <giordanoj1@usf.edu>
Description: An environmental chemical company uses standardized databases for each of their chemicals. This tool will read the company's database, summarize the information by X, Y, and Z. Where multiple timepoints are available for the same study trial, this tool will model the half-life (based on CAKE guidance?). This tool will offer some sort of visualization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
